WEBVTT

00:03:56.464 --> 00:04:00.320
a less technical, broader audience
was coming into contact

00:04:00.344 --> 00:04:02.289
with this equipment for the first time.

00:04:02.313 --> 00:04:07.978
I once had the distinct privilege
of sitting in on the Apple call center

00:04:08.002 --> 00:04:09.162
for a day.

00:04:09.186 --> 00:04:11.976
The guy had a duplicate headset
for me to listen to.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.526
And the calls that --
you know how they say,

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:18.280
"Your call may be recorded
for quality assurance?"

00:04:18.304 --> 00:04:19.573
Uh-uh.

00:04:19.597 --> 00:04:20.976
Your call may be recorded

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.668
so that they can collect
the funniest dumb user stories

00:04:23.692 --> 00:04:25.183
and pass them around on a CD.

00:04:25.207 --> 00:04:26.247
(Laughter)

00:04:26.271 --> 00:04:27.976
Which they do.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.592
(Laughter)

00:04:29.616 --> 00:04:30.838
And I have a copy.